    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just feel so drained. honestly i dont think i have the energy to drive to a doctor right now or even deal with the waiting room. it's probably just stress or something since i didn't sleep well last night. u think if i just take a couple of my sleep aids and sleep for like 4 or 5 hours i'll wake up feeling normal? like is it safe to just sleep through this heaviness?",
